{
  "text": "Your mindset around opportunity is either expanding your business or quietly shrinking it. It is your responsibility as a business owner and a professional to take every single opportunity God poses in front of you. The reason you're not where you want to be in the real estate business or honestly, any business is because you're not taking the opportunities that you think are small. The ones that don't look the way you thought they would and the ones that feel beneath where you think you should be. That right there is the difference between being stagnant and actually growing between being busy and building something. Your mindset around opportunity is either expanding your business or quietly shrinking it. Stop waiting for the opportunity you pictured and start saying yes to the one God actually sent.",
